I often like the idea of doing a level of the mines, a level of the
main dungeon, back and forth in a cycle until I find the upstairs to
Sokoban.  Then some amount of cycling between the mines and
Sokoban branches.  It's a paranoid method that gives my characters
plenty of travel time between levels to heal.

But do it that way now and your pet will be ferral by the time you
next encounter it.  Hope the trap door only dropped it one level and
try to clear out this level fast enough that when you descend it
won't be ferral.  That and keep a non-veg food item to throw.



